snmpdigger (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New Interfaces tab: live IF-MIB dashboard with per-port bit/s,
    utilisation, errors and discards.
  * New Watch tab: a persistent pin-board of objects with live values,
    per-second rates and sparklines.
  * Discovery: scan by AS number (--asn, prefixes resolved via RIPEstat)
    or across the host's local networks (--local); streaming multi-range
    sweep with a MaxHosts cap; compact form; pre-filled fast connect.
  * CSV export (e) from Discovery, Interfaces, Browser and Watch.
  * New CLI subcommand: monitor (a scriptable watch(1) for SNMP);
    discover --asn / --local / --max-hosts.
  * [ ] always switch tabs, even from a focused text field.

 -- kawaiipantsu <12233528+kawaiipantsu@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 10:40:00 +0000

